{"seq":1,"slug":"inventory-availability-state-taxonomy","title":"库存可用量与状态分类模型：on-hand/ATP/预留/安全库存/在途的统一语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/unified-inventory-data-model/inventory-availability-state-taxonomy","wordCount":2520,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"库存可用量与状态分类模型-on-hand-atp-预留-安全库存-在途的统一语义\">库存可用量与状态分类模型：on-hand/ATP/预留/安全库存/在途的统一语义</h1><p>跨境电商的库存系统里最贵的一类 bug，不是&quot;算错了数字&quot;，而是&quot;同一批货在两个系统里有两个不同的名字&quot;。同一个 SKU，深圳仓的 WMS 说它 <code>on_hand = 120</code>，独立站的 OMS 说它 <code>available = 95</code>，Amazon 后台说可售 88，而客服看到的 ERP 报表写的是在库 120。四个数字都&quot;对&quot;，但没有一个能直接拿来回答顾客那句话：&quot;我现在下单，什么时候能发？&quot;本文要解决的正是这件事——把物理库存拆成一组<strong>互斥、可加、有确定运算规则</strong>的可用量状态，让仓库、门店、在途、渠道四条链路说同一种语言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-一个数字-到-一组状态\">核心概念：从&quot;一个数字&quot;到&quot;一组状态&quot;</h2><p>物理库存的原始事实只有一个：某地点某时刻有多少件。但&quot;能卖&quot;是一个<strong>派生量</strong>，它取决于这批货被哪些意图锁定、哪些货暂时不可用、以及未来还有多少会到。把这两者混成一个字段，是所有超卖（overselling）问题的根源。</p>\n<p>行业里已经把这件事标准化了。Shopify 的 Inventory Management API 定义了八个状态，并给出了一条关键的守恒关系（<a href=\"https://shopify.dev/docs/apps/build/orders-fulfillment/inventory-management-apps/manage-quantities-states\">Shopify Dev Docs, inventory states</a>）：</p>\n<p><code>on_hand = available + committed + reserved + damaged + safety_stock + quality_control</code></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>on_hand</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>available</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>committed</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>reserved</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>damaged</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>safety_stock</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>quality_control</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_{\\text{on\\_hand}} = Q_{\\text{available}} + Q_{\\text{committed}} + Q_{\\text{reserved}} + Q_{\\text{damaged}} + Q_{\\text{safety\\_stock}} + Q_{\\text{quality\\_control}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">on_hand</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">available</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">committed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reserved</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">damaged</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">safety_stock</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quality_control</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条等式的价值在于：它把&quot;不可售&quot;的每一种原因都显式建模，而不是用一个模糊的 <code>unavailable</code> 字段兜底。<code>incoming</code>（在途/预期到货）<strong>不在</strong>等式右边——它是未来供给，不是当前持有。一旦你把 <code>incoming</code> 塞进 <code>on_hand</code>，就等于把&quot;还没到货的货&quot;当成&quot;现在能发的货&quot;卖给顾客，履约时必然退款。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六个可加状态的定义边界\">六个可加状态的定义边界</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th align=\"center\">是否计入 on_hand</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>谁有权修改</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>on_hand</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">—（是总和）</td>\n<td>某地点物理持有的总量</td>\n<td>收货/盘点/调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>available</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>当前可承诺售卖的余额</td>\n<td>由其它状态推导，不直接写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>committed</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>已被订单占用（已下单未发）</td>\n<td>订单系统独占，WMS 不得直接改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reserved</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>为某顾客/某意图保留但尚未成单</td>\n<td>客服、预售、调拨锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>damaged</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>破损、变质，不可售</td>\n<td>收货质检、门店报损</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>safety_stock</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>预留的抗波动缓冲</td>\n<td>商品/品类策略配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>quality_control</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\">是</td>\n<td>待质检、未放行</td>\n<td>质检流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>incoming</code></td>\n<td align=\"center\"><strong>否</strong></td>\n<td>已下采购单/调拨单、尚未到货</td>\n<td>采购、调拨</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键设计约束是<strong>所有权分离</strong>：<code>available</code> 是推导量，任何系统都不应直接覆写它，只能通过调整其它状态或触发移动（move）来间接改变。Shopify 文档明确说明 <code>committed</code> 由平台侧的订单履约动作管理，App 不能直接调整或移动它；<code>available</code> 则是&quot;每个层级上该库存项的可用数量&quot;，即不可用状态之外的剩余部分。把 <code>available</code> 设为只读推导量，能避免最常见的竞态：两个并发请求各自读到 95，各自写回 94，结果卖了 2 件只减了 1 件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"状态的迁移而非赋值\">状态的迁移而非赋值</h3><p>状态的改变应当被建模为<strong>带方向的迁移</strong>，而不是原地赋值。以下是单地点内一次完整生命周期的主干迁移。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PO[在途 incoming] --&gt;|收货上架| OH[在库 on_hand]&#10;    OH --&gt;|质检放行| AV[可售 available]&#10;    OH --&gt;|质检未放行| QC[待检 quality_control]&#10;    QC --&gt;|放行| AV&#10;    QC --&gt;|判损| DM[破损 damaged]&#10;    AV --&gt;|下单占用| CM[已承诺 committed]&#10;    AV --&gt;|客服/预售锁定| RS[预留 reserved]&#10;    CM --&gt;|发货出库| SH[已发出 shipped]&#10;    RS --&gt;|成单| CM&#10;    RS --&gt;|释放| AV&#10;    CM --&gt;|取消/退货回库| AV&#10;    OH --&gt;|策略划拨| SS[安全库存 safety_stock]&#10;    SS --&gt;|释放策略| AV\">graph TD\n    PO[在途 incoming] --&gt;|收货上架| OH[在库 on_hand]\n    OH --&gt;|质检放行| AV[可售 available]\n    OH --&gt;|质检未放行| QC[待检 quality_control]\n    QC --&gt;|放行| AV\n    QC --&gt;|判损| DM[破损 damaged]\n    AV --&gt;|下单占用| CM[已承诺 committed]\n    AV --&gt;|客服/预售锁定| RS[预留 reserved]\n    CM --&gt;|发货出库| SH[已发出 shipped]\n    RS --&gt;|成单| CM\n    RS --&gt;|释放| AV\n    CM --&gt;|取消/退货回库| AV\n    OH --&gt;|策略划拨| SS[安全库存 safety_stock]\n    SS --&gt;|释放策略| AV</pre><p>每条边都是一次原子操作，必须可在事件日志中重放。这也解释了为什么 <code>incoming → on_hand</code> 的边<strong>不能</strong>在采购单创建时就触发：只有当收货确认（仓库实收）后，货才真正从&quot;预期&quot;变成&quot;持有&quot;。Shopify 的 scheduled change 机制正是这个语义——变更计划<strong>说明</strong>某日期数量预期从 <code>incoming</code> 转为 <code>available</code>，但计划本身不改动库存；实际库存要等收货动作落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"atp-把状态投影成-能承诺什么\">ATP：把状态投影成&quot;能承诺什么&quot;</h2><p><code>available</code> 回答的是&quot;现在有多少能卖&quot;，而 ATP（Available-to-Promise，可承诺量）回答的是&quot;我敢对顾客承诺什么、什么时候&quot;。两者不是同一个量:前者是地点级的现货视图，后者是<strong>跨地点、跨时间窗</strong>的承诺投影。</p>\n<p>ATP 的经典定义是&quot;基于资源可用性对客户订单询价给出的响应，提供可用产品数量与交付日期&quot;，其输入包括当前库存、计划收货（生产/采购订单）以及计划需求（销售订单、交货单、预留）（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Available_to_promise\">Wikipedia: Available to promise</a>）。它既可以逐单实时计算，也可以定期批处理后在承诺前统一下发。</p>\n<p>在多节点网络里，ATP 必须考虑<strong>网络可达性</strong>——并非所有库存都能用于履约同一个订单。一个只在深圳仓有货、但顾客在德国且要求次日达的订单，其可用 ATP 通常是 0，因为跨境调拨的时间窗根本来不及。因此实际工程中 ATP 一般形式化为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ATP</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>elig</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>avail</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>incoming</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>committed</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mtext>reserved</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ATP}(n, t) = \\sum_{i \\in N_{\\text{elig}}(n)} \\Big( Q_{\\text{avail}}(i,t) + \\sum_{\\tau \\le t} Q_{\\text{incoming}}(i,\\tau) - Q_{\\text{committed}}(i,\\tau) - Q_{\\text{reserved}}(i,\\tau) \\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ATP</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6941em;vertical-align:-1.5441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">avail</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4064em;vertical-align:-1.3564em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8888em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3564em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">incoming</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">committed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reserved</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>elig</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{elig}}(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是对订单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 在承诺时限内<strong>实际可履约</strong>的节点集合（受配送时效、清关能力、渠道授权约束），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 是承诺日。这个式子里最容易被漏掉的就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>elig</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{elig}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elig</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上的过滤：很多团队把全球所有节点的 <code>available</code> 直接相加当作 ATP，结果是前台显示&quot;全球有货 5000 件&quot;，而顾客发现本地仓早就缺货，履约时效承诺形同虚设。</p>\n<p>一个稳健的实践是<strong>分层 ATP</strong>：先算单节点 ATP（节点内可承诺），再按履约拓扑做网络聚合，最后按渠道做可见性裁剪。三层各自有独立的缓存与失效策略，任一层出问题都不会污染其它层的语义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四类-不可售-的区别是业务含义-不是技术细节\">四类&quot;不可售&quot;的区别是业务含义，不是技术细节</h2><p>把 <code>damaged</code>、<code>safety_stock</code>、<code>quality_control</code>、<code>reserved</code> 都塞进一个 <code>unavailable</code> 字段在代码上更省事，但在运营上会立刻崩坏，因为这四者的<strong>释放路径完全不同</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>damaged</code> 通常不可逆，走报损或退货供应商流程，永远不该回到 <code>available</code>；</li>\n<li><code>quality_control</code> 是<strong>暂态</strong>，质检放行后应回到 <code>available</code>，判损后转 <code>damaged</code>；把它和 <code>damaged</code> 合并会导致&quot;本可放行的货被永久冻结&quot;；</li>\n<li><code>safety_stock</code> 是<strong>可调策略</strong>，旺季可以下调以释放可售量，是唯一一类&quot;人为设定、随时可撤&quot;的不可售；</li>\n<li><code>reserved</code> 有<strong>明确归属</strong>，能追踪到具体顾客或具体意图，释放会比取消订单更容易。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>合并它们会抹掉这些释放语义，让任何一次&quot;把不可售释放出来&quot;的操作都无法判断该释放多少、释放给谁。在跨境电商里这一点尤其致命：跨境在途货要过清关，长时间停在 <code>quality_control</code>（等查验）是常态，把它误并入 <code>damaged</code> 会让大量实际可售的货被系统永久隐藏，缺货率虚高。</p>\n<p>同理，<code>reserved</code> 内部还应区分<strong>成单前预留</strong>（如购物车锁、预售名额）和<strong>成单后承诺</strong>（<code>committed</code>）。二者的可释放性和超时策略不同：前者需要 TTL 自动过期回滚，后者需要走取消/退款流程。把它们混为一谈，会导致购物车放弃的货永远锁死，或者已下单的货被 TTL 误释放给别人的订单——这正是超卖的经典触发路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态模型的工程落地要点\">状态模型的工程落地要点</h2><p><strong>幂等与对账。</strong> 每一次状态迁移都应携带业务单据 ID，写入不可变事件流，并支持从事件流重算任一地点任一时刻的快照。对账的目标不是&quot;数字一致&quot;，而是&quot;守恒式成立&quot;：任取一个地点，<code>on_hand</code> 必须恒等于六个可加状态之和，任何偏差都是事件丢失或重复的直接证据。</p>\n<p><strong>时区与时间窗。</strong> 承诺跨时区，&quot;当天到货&quot;在不同站点是不同时刻。所有 <code>incoming</code> 的期望到货时间应存为带时区的绝对时刻，ATP 计算时再按顾客站点转换，绝不在存储层做模糊的&quot;日期&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>渠道可见性不等于库存状态。</strong> 库存状态是全球共享的事实，但&quot;哪个渠道能看到多少&quot;是策略。同一批 95 件 <code>available</code>，独立站可以全量展示，某平台店可能只允许展示 70（预留渠道配额），这属于可见性层的规则，不应回写进库存状态本身——否则一旦渠道策略调整，你会分不清这个 95 是真实可用还是被某个渠道裁剪后的投影。</p>\n<p><strong>负库存要不要允许。</strong> 允许负 <code>available</code> 是一种&quot;先卖后补&quot;的策略，能提高转化但会放大履约失败。若要允许，必须限制在明确标记的商品/渠道上，并让 <code>on_hand</code> 守恒式在含负值时仍可解释（即负值只出现在 <code>available</code> 这一个推导量上，物理持有量永不为负）。</p>\n<p>更深一层的聚合与实时同步机制（如何把这些状态在多节点间秒级对齐、处理乱序事件与分区），属于本 hub 的下一章，见 <a href=\"../real-time-aggregation-sync/\">实时聚合与同步 INDEX</a>；而状态模型如何被下游的承诺与履约消费，见 <a href=\"../omnichannel-promise-fulfillment/\">全渠道承诺与履约 INDEX</a>。本数据模型章的剩余位置与整体规划见 <a href=\"../unified-inventory-data-model/\">统一库存数据模型 INDEX</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>库存可用量的本质是把一个物理事实（持有多少）投影成一组业务意图（能承诺什么）。on-hand 与六个可加状态构成守恒式，<code>incoming</code> 独立于守恒式之外；<code>available</code> 是只读推导量，靠状态迁移而非原地赋值改变；ATP 是跨节点、跨时间窗、经履约可达性过滤后的承诺投影，不等于任何单节点的 <code>available</code>。四类不可售状态必须分开建模，因为它们的释放路径、可逆性和归属完全不同。落地时守住三条：状态迁移幂等可重放、守恒式可对账、渠道可见性与库存状态分离。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"库存可用量与状态分类模型：on-hand/ATP/预留/安全库存/在途的统一语义","id":"库存可用量与状态分类模型-on-hand-atp-预留-安全库存-在途的统一语义"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从\"一个数字\"到\"一组状态\"","id":"核心概念-从-一个数字-到-一组状态"},{"level":3,"text":"六个可加状态的定义边界","id":"六个可加状态的定义边界"},{"level":3,"text":"状态的迁移而非赋值","id":"状态的迁移而非赋值"},{"level":2,"text":"ATP：把状态投影成\"能承诺什么\"","id":"atp-把状态投影成-能承诺什么"},{"level":2,"text":"四类\"不可售\"的区别是业务含义，不是技术细节","id":"四类-不可售-的区别是业务含义-不是技术细节"},{"level":2,"text":"状态模型的工程落地要点","id":"状态模型的工程落地要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"库存位置与渠道节点层级建模：仓/门店/在途/虚拟位置的聚合关系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/omnichannel-inventory-visibility-platform/unified-inventory-data-model/location-node-channel-hierarchy"}}